<title>HONG KONG: Winfoong Int'l 1996 net falls 87 pct.</title>
<headline>Winfoong Int'l 1996 net falls 87 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.35	vs  2.98</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs  1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  6.95 loss vs  42.65 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    2.04	vs  16.15</p>
<p>    Turnover		     496.86    vs  464.10</p>
<p>    Company name		 Winfoong International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Winfoong International is a property investment and development company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$6.95 million representing the revaluation deficit of investment properties held by a non-wholly-owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs one H.K. cent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
